Package: libomx-contract-dev
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: FreeMixer declarations as data, rendered as C headers
 omx-contract holds the declarations the FreeMixer DSP library and plugins
 build against (travels, defaults, kernel constants, rates and plugin
 parameter selections) as JSON data with a JSON Schema, and their renders.
 .
 This package holds the c render under /usr/include/omxcontract, the
 resolved json render and the schema under /usr/share/omx-contract, and
 omx-contract.pc. A consumer requires it at exactly the version it pins.
